			{"text": "Not yet.", "to": ""},
		]},
		"bread": {"say": "You set the loaf on the shelf and fold the cloth in thirds, corners in, the way she folds them. You step back. The breathing stops, and then, very slowly, a hand comes out of the dark, takes the loaf, and goes back in. It is gaunt, and clean, and does not tremble. You go quietly away.", "who": "", "do": "qp:vow_cell:bread,qa:vow_cell", "next": ""},
		"name": {"say": "You say it through the wall, low, a name from the ledger, the first line, nine winters old. The breathing stops. A long time passes. Then, from inside, one word, in a voice that is dry as old paper: here. It is not an answer to a name. It is an answer to being called.", "who": "", "do": "qp:vow_cell:name,qa:vow_cell", "next": ""},
		"break": {"say": "You take the top stone off the wall, and the next, and the next. They come away easily, as if they had been waiting. Behind them is the niche, and in it a shape in grey wool that does not move. A lantern hangs at its hip. It is very tidy. It has been very patient. The last stone falls.", "who": "", "do": "qp:vow_cell:break,qa:vow_cell", "next": ""},
		"gone": {"say_if": [["qp:vow_cell:bread", "The loaf is gone from the shelf, and the cloth is folded."], ["qp:vow_cell:name", "The wall is quiet. A single word is scratched beside the niche: here."], ["qp:vow_cell:break", "The wall is down."], ["", "The wall stands, with its niche, and its shelf."]], "who": "", "next": ""},
